This is a good FPS game and the team work is excellent (it's in the name).
I am quite experienced at TF2 and mostly know the ins and outs of it, so here is my feedback.
Postive:
The choice of weapons in this game are excellent;
It's mostly (I repeat mostly) not a pay to win game;
For a free game it's 10/10;
You dont have to have all the cool stuff to be good;
It's really good if you want to just play around with friends;
Playing with friends is really easy and fun;
The co-op side of game play is also fun;
The range of cool stuff you can get is pretty wide e.g hats with stuff flying round them;
You can freaking rocket jump and sticky jump whats not to like!
Well there is stuff not to like, but anyway...
Negatives:
I dont really have much to say but here we go,
If you join a game and it is unbalanced (not the teams but the players) then it can be hard playing;
People can hack and cheat and make the game a right old misery (just ignore them).
Tips:
Play with the classes your good at and not the ones you are not good at.
Well I definitely could have said more but I don't really want to drone on.
I recommend this game.

